            "sid": "LEV 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose guri báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Xoorór Israeli kabeeto, deeloorí an deelór uren ar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, tidá' taa qoomeés, dinku'uumár hhoohhoo' an tlehhá'. Deelór ur ar naa qoomeés an tí: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deelo lahhooe gadiyeé an tlehhá', ala bál faanqw a baalár Sabaáto. Baalaarihe a gadiyusa'aaká, dinku'uumár hhoohhoo' an tlehhá'. Bál faanqwe a gadiyusa'aaká, an Sabaáto, an baalár taa paraátl as anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ baraá hotaahúng sleémeero umuúqo diiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deelor'eé' ar uren ar hatlá' ar anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ar dinku'uumár hhoohhoo' kawa tlehha', a baraá qom'iiká taa qoomeés.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Tsiindaá baalár mibaá nee tsiyáhh awa slahhángw geera an baalár Pasaáka kuwa boo/esa' as anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál mibaá nee kooán ar slahhangwduú kilá' deelór ur ar mikaátér taa sluuftisiiká in iimu/uún. Deelo faanqw mikaátér taa sluuftisiiká an /agá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál deelór geera dinku'uumár hhoohhoo' an tlehhá', baalaarihe ma gadiyuusara'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deeloorí faanqwamaawo anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ in ilahhooár dá/tí hanimisá'. Bál faanqwe dinku'uuma an tlehhá', ma gadiyuusara'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose guri báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Xoorór Israeli kabeeto, bara daté' baraá yaamuusingá' naa haniís, bar aga bu'uundé', ufuú balaangw oo bu'úngw geera un hubá' amór kaahamusmoó Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmoó Mungú ufuuduú balaangw guri gáwtí tlees as nguwa haniisi dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, as kahhó' kuungá' tunduwa ya/an. Adoorí ngi tleehhi matloowós baalár Sabaáto bira waaráhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalaasíng ufeedá' ngiwa hanisa' dír anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, ilahhooár da/a ar deelmoó gwaanda oo xaslxaansli wásl, oo kurkú wák, ngun hanisá' sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dinkwa nee tisinge ilahhooár bu'úngw afi qoomár kílo tsár ar puuruú natsaatsaá' oo taa aleedoók nee di/i ngun hanisá' dír anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ar asla, nee slaahhareeriiwós aníng iri sla'atisiyá'. Ilahhooarós ar wahaangw a liíta wak ar difaái. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dír ilahhooarhúng ngira hubi'iiká amor'eé', anuú Munguúhúng, i hariindaaká bu'úngw geera oo balangwhúng kuwa qiintír wa /aga', laqaá kuwa da/a/aanda', laqaá kuwa mikaátér wa tlehha'. Gaarí an dawa oo ta eehada' baraá qartahúng sleémeero umuúqo diiro ar tawa hota'a ay alhhe'eesáy wasle.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Iimír baalaadár alaá Sabaátoro, tidá' ilahhooár ufuú balaangw kunguwa gáwtí tleés, as kunguwa haniisi dír anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, wiikidaá faanqw awa ádkoomá' in fadá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál mibeeri kooán, baalár alaá Sabaátór faanqw ilahhooár bu'úngw /abén duuxare' as anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo do'o mikaáte tsár kan haniis as tawa ilahhooár ta gáwtí tlesa' as ngiwa hanisa' dír anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. Umuúqo mukatmoowo masók gár kungura tleéhh a kílo tsár ar puuruú natsaatsaá' oo taa sluuftís. Mikaáteesíng ngin hubá' dír anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ as tawa ilahhooár bu'úngw geera dirhunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dinkwa nee tihe deeloó faanqw oo bee/aangw oo kurkú wák oo xaslxaanslír koomaaká un haniisa', nee awuú batlitmo oo wák, nee gwaandaawe tsár. Makaysingá' an ilahhooár da/a dinkwa nee ilahhooár bu'uungw nee ilahhooár wahaangw. Slaahhareeraá ilahhooarí anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ iri sla'atisiyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gurta ngun ilahhooár tlakweema hingeesár wa hanisá', nee deeloó tsár oo gwaandaawe, oo kurkú wák, un tsu/á' as ilahhooár wayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmoó Mungú giri gáwtí tlees as tawa ilahhooár ni haniisi dír anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, dinkwa nee mukaatmoó bu'úngw geera, nee deelaydá' tsár oo bee/aangw. Muruusíng a muruú hhohhó' dír anuú AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, nee a muruú /aymár kaahamusmoó Mungú kilós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalaasír kilae kángw dinku'uumár hhoohhoo' kuri ilahanisá', baalaadae a gadiyusa'aaká. Gaarí an dákw ta eehada' ay alhhe'eesay wasle baraá xwaylarhúng sleémeero, umuúqo dír tawa hota'a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
