            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose guri báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Xoorór Israeli baweek: Iimír bál mibaá nee kooán ar slahhángw faanqw, deelór ur an tlehhá' ar isleeri deelo faanqw as AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalár hargeera baraá deeloosíng faanqwe dinku'uumár hhoohhoo' a koondá', baalaasinge ma gadiyusara'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deeloosíng faanqwe ilahhooár da/a an hanmisá' dir anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, bál dakaát dinku'uumár hhoohhoo' an boo/esá', nee ilahhooár da/a an hanisá' dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. Dinku'uumadá' ka hhoohhoo', baalaasinge ma gadiyusara'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Deeloosíng an deelór uren ar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ar taa qoomeés nee as kaangw kuwa ilahanisa' as dinku'uumár hhoohhoo' kawa tlehha', ar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuwa ilahhooár dá/tí hanmisa', nee ar bu'uungo, nee ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i, nee ar wahaango. Ilahhooarí sleémeero kan daa/, umuúqo ilahhooaro nee baalaarós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilahhooasíng a dinkwa nee tidá' ni hanmisa' dír anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. Bál deelór Sabaátoro, adoodár ilahhooadá' /iisí kar hanmaamisa', ilahhooadár al'axweesani kawa boo/esa', nee ilahhooár muunuú sla'aariro, tidá' ni hanmaamisa' dír anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Alaá bu'úngw qamuhunge deelór ur ngin tlehhá' ar deelo faanqw, iimír deelór mibaá nee kooán ar slahhángw faanqw. Baalár hargeera nee bál dakaát a baalár hungu/uma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál deelór geera mamaá xaaihúng awa tsuuá' ki lehhá', nee haleemaá xaa'aá loo/o yaariir nee haleemaá ti'imaamitá' baraá afaá yaaér wa ale, kuungá' deelór ur kari tlehhá' deelo faanqw geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuú kurko deeloorí an tlehhá' deelo faanqw as anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, adoorí an tlehhitá' umuúqo slahhángw faanqwe. Gaarí an dákw ta eehada' baraá qari sleémeero ay alhhe'eesay wasle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deelo faanqwe an hotá' baraá xafáy wa ale. Qoomaasíng sleémeero yaamuloouusér Israeli nin baraá xafáy wa hootiyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlehhmuuwí xwaylarhúng gan xu'utimis adór aníng baabi'iihúng ngira duúx baraá yaamaá Misrír wa aleeró, niri baraá xafáy wa hootiyé'. Aníng an AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
